509
01:28:13.810 --> 01:28:15.810
Scheduled for Tuesday evening by the way.

510
01:28:15.810 --> 01:28:17.810
I just came from the hospital.

511
01:28:17.810 --> 01:28:19.810
And Tuesday evening immediately a board meeting.

512
01:28:19.810 --> 01:28:21.810
With the construction team present.

513
01:28:21.810 --> 01:28:23.810
And I say, guys, this.

514
01:28:23.810 --> 01:28:25.810
I think the answer is clear.

515
01:28:25.810 --> 01:28:26.810
This is not going to work.

516
01:28:26.810 --> 01:28:28.810
Because we have raised 200,000.

517
01:28:28.810 --> 01:28:31.810
Through that crowdfunding situation.

518
01:28:31.810 --> 01:28:33.810
But it's not 200,000 on 750,000.

519
01:28:33.810 --> 01:28:34.810
Those first trends.

520
01:28:34.810 --> 01:28:38.810
Then another one of 950,000 should come a few months later.

521
01:28:38.810 --> 01:28:42.810
So you have to see 200,000 within 3 weeks on 1.7 million.

522
01:28:42.810 --> 01:28:44.810
That is a no-go.

523
01:28:44.810 --> 01:28:46.810
That is simply a no-go.

524
01:28:46.810 --> 01:28:50.810
Then you can ask yourself.

525
01:28:50.810 --> 01:28:56.810
When is the right moment to say, it is or it isn't?

526
01:28:56.810 --> 01:28:58.810
You need a board for that.

527
01:28:58.810 --> 01:28:59.810
You need a construction team for that.

528
01:28:59.810 --> 01:29:02.810
You need the input of the believers for that.

529
01:29:02.810 --> 01:29:09.810
So you need the indications of, okay, how do we determine when it is a yes or a no?

530
01:29:09.810 --> 01:29:17.810
Now, what is an objective date from which we can say whether it will be or not?

531
01:29:17.810 --> 01:29:23.810
The 2 objective things that are yes or no are 1, value for your money itself.

532
01:29:23.810 --> 01:29:26.810
When they say, we don't see it happening anymore.

533
01:29:26.810 --> 01:29:28.810
Then that is objective.

534
01:29:28.810 --> 01:29:29.810
They are it.

535
01:29:29.810 --> 01:29:31.810
And 2, the construction company.

536
01:29:31.810 --> 01:29:38.810
And the construction company has told us, guys, we need an answer by January 6th.

537
01:29:38.810 --> 01:29:41.810
January 6th was Tuesday.

538
01:29:41.810 --> 01:29:46.810
That Tuesday when I came out of the hospital and had a board meeting, that was January 6th.

539
01:29:46.810 --> 01:29:50.810
So I tell the board and the construction team, guys, this is January 6th.

540
01:29:50.810 --> 01:29:53.810
That is a defined moment.

541
01:29:53.810 --> 01:29:59.810
That is an objective moment where I have to respond to a construction company.

542
01:29:59.810 --> 01:30:02.810
This is a moment of yes or no.

543
01:30:02.810 --> 01:30:06.810
And so we have interpreted with the construction team and with the board.

544
01:30:06.810 --> 01:30:08.810
This is not it.

545
01:30:08.810 --> 01:30:16.810
Not with disappointment, but with yes is hallelujah here and no is hallelujah here.

546
01:30:16.810 --> 01:30:19.810
So then you decide in faith.

547
01:30:19.810 --> 01:30:21.810
Because, here we go again.

548
01:30:21.810 --> 01:30:24.810
All rollercoasters of thoughts from people.

549
01:30:24.810 --> 01:30:28.810
Yes, but you have to have faith that it will happen with value for your money.

550
01:30:28.810 --> 01:30:29.810
Hey, wait a minute.

551
01:30:29.810 --> 01:30:35.810
If I go to that board meeting and say that the banks have said no and now value for your money says no.

552
01:30:35.810 --> 01:30:40.810
And I say but I am sure it will come, that is also faith.

553
01:30:40.810 --> 01:30:44.810
And I am the only one who is enthusiastic.

554
01:30:44.810 --> 01:30:49.810
Believe me, you just know, your options are up.

555
01:30:49.810 --> 01:30:52.810
And then you say to the Lord, praise the Lord.

556
01:30:52.810 --> 01:30:54.810
Because it is going to happen.

557
01:30:54.810 --> 01:30:55.810
Praise the Lord.

558
01:30:55.810 --> 01:31:00.810
So, on Tuesday evening I meet with the board and with the construction team.

559
01:31:00.810 --> 01:31:03.810
Value for your money has said, guys it is not going to work.

560
01:31:03.810 --> 01:31:06.810
We see it, this is not it.

561
01:31:06.810 --> 01:31:12.810
On Thursday morning I called Johan van Buren, the director.

562
01:31:12.810 --> 01:31:14.810
And I said one more time, Johan what do you think?

563
01:31:14.810 --> 01:31:17.810
And Johan said, I am saddened.

564
01:31:17.810 --> 01:31:20.810
I am disappointed.

565
01:31:20.810 --> 01:31:24.810
I am disappointed in Christian Netherlands, he also said.

566
01:31:24.810 --> 01:31:30.810
That other Christians from other denominations, traditional churches, especially Christian Netherlands.

567
01:31:30.810 --> 01:31:37.810
That they do not have a warm heart towards an evangelical church like ours.

568
01:31:37.810 --> 01:31:39.810
Disappointment.

569
01:31:39.810 --> 01:31:42.810
And I want to share that as a side note.

570
01:31:42.810 --> 01:31:45.810
Just pray for unity in God's kingdom.

571
01:31:45.810 --> 01:31:49.810
Because I see, I am as naïve as I am grown up in that regard.

572
01:31:49.810 --> 01:31:54.810
As far as I am concerned, everyone who professes the name of Jesus is a Christian.

573
01:31:54.810 --> 01:32:01.810
As far as I am concerned, everyone who professes, Jesus died here on a cross, rose for my sin.

574
01:32:01.810 --> 01:32:04.810
In my opinion, that is the bride of Jesus Christ.

575
01:32:04.810 --> 01:32:06.810
And I mean that seriously.

576
01:32:06.810 --> 01:32:10.810
Whether you are Protestant, or Catholic, or Orthodox.

577
01:32:10.810 --> 01:32:13.810
Yes, there is a lot to fix in the Catholic Church.

578
01:32:13.810 --> 01:32:15.810
Yes, there is also a lot to fix in an open church.

579
01:32:15.810 --> 01:32:16.810
Believe me.

580
01:32:16.810 --> 01:32:17.810
Do you understand what I mean?

581
01:32:17.810 --> 01:32:19.810
Do not throw mud anymore and do not reject anyone.

582
01:32:19.810 --> 01:32:22.810
For the Bible says, if you judge, you will be judged yourself.

583
01:32:22.810 --> 01:32:23.810
That is really true.

584
01:32:23.810 --> 01:32:26.810
Is there sin in the camp? Just pray for the Catholics.

585
01:32:26.810 --> 01:32:29.810
Is there false theology? Just pray for the Catholics.

586
01:32:29.810 --> 01:32:31.810
Is there spiritism? Just pray for the Catholics.

587
01:32:31.810 --> 01:32:33.810
The Orthodox can also be part of it.

588
01:32:33.810 --> 01:32:36.810
And the evangelicals, they can be crazy sometimes too.

589
01:32:36.810 --> 01:32:37.810
Yes, really true.

590
01:32:37.810 --> 01:32:40.810
Our theology is not always correct either.

591
01:32:40.810 --> 01:32:42.810
Or very often not correct.

592
01:32:42.810 --> 01:32:47.810
And that is why we must do our best to stay close to the pure Word of God.

593
01:32:47.810 --> 01:32:52.810
Everything that is man-made added to it is man-made added and very dangerous.

594
01:32:52.810 --> 01:32:55.810
If you stay very close to God's Word, then you remain pure.

595
01:32:55.810 --> 01:32:56.810
Believe me.

596
01:32:56.810 --> 01:32:58.810
That is the thing for 2026.

597
01:32:58.810 --> 01:33:01.810
Stay close to the Bible.

598
01:33:01.810 --> 01:33:02.810
Amen.

599
01:33:03.810 --> 01:33:09.810
And so, Thursday morning, at ten o'clock in the morning, I have Johan van Buuren on the phone.

600
01:33:09.810 --> 01:33:14.810
And we are together on the phone, with a bit of disappointment about the result,

601
01:33:14.810 --> 01:33:17.810
we said, then we are now pulling the plug.

602
01:33:17.810 --> 01:33:19.810
Then we stop with value for your money.

603
01:33:19.810 --> 01:33:23.810
And I told Johan what we had done with that piece of paper,

604
01:33:23.810 --> 01:33:28.810
that we had prayed together and that we believe together in the growth of the Lord.

605
01:33:28.810 --> 01:33:31.810
We believe together in the provision of the Lord. Amen.

606
01:33:31.810 --> 01:33:34.810
I gave that to him as a way to encourage him,

607
01:33:34.810 --> 01:33:39.810
to say, Johan, you are a Christian, I am a Christian, we are brothers in Christ together.

608
01:33:39.810 --> 01:33:41.810
Don't worry about it, God will take care of us.

609
01:33:41.810 --> 01:33:44.810
And he said, thank you for saying that, I appreciate it.

610
01:33:44.810 --> 01:33:46.810
Because he is thinking about a disappointment commercially.

611
01:33:46.810 --> 01:33:47.810
Do you understand what I mean?

612
01:33:48.810 --> 01:33:54.810
And so, Thursday morning, I had that conversation with value for your money,

613
01:33:54.810 --> 01:34:02.810
while two days earlier, on January 6, I should have given a final answer to Altes, our construction company.

614
01:34:03.810 --> 01:34:10.810
So I had that Friday, last Friday, an appointment with Altes in Oudsbergen,

615
01:34:10.810 --> 01:34:18.810
to apologize, to excuse ourselves, that we did not get the financing arranged.

616
01:34:18.810 --> 01:34:21.810
Listen carefully, Church, we have built this neatly into contracts.

617
01:34:21.810 --> 01:34:25.810
We signed a contract that includes a disclaimer,

618
01:34:25.810 --> 01:34:28.810
we will build provided we have the financing arranged.

619
01:34:28.810 --> 01:34:30.810
We did not proceed carelessly.

620
01:34:30.810 --> 01:34:33.810
We handled this properly with Altes.

621
01:34:33.810 --> 01:34:37.810
The moment you have to say no is not pleasant.

622
01:34:38.810 --> 01:34:44.810
And with that feeling, with that stress, I want to show you my rollercoaster of the past week,

623
01:34:44.810 --> 01:34:48.810
with that stress a bit, I get into my car, I drive to Altes,

624
01:34:48.810 --> 01:34:53.810
and I sit there with the manager and the project manager at Altes.

625
01:34:54.810 --> 01:34:58.810
I deliberately brought a business card, I'm going to think of something for that man.

626
01:34:58.810 --> 01:35:04.810
And the manager is sitting there in front of me, I've never seen him before.

627
01:35:04.810 --> 01:35:09.810
At first, he sits there with his arms crossed and I think, I don't know what this is going to be about.

628
01:35:09.810 --> 01:35:11.810
Maybe it's going to be a very unpleasant conversation.

629
01:35:11.810 --> 01:35:13.810
Inside me, it was a bit scary.

630
01:35:13.810 --> 01:35:15.810
I was there with some...

631
01:35:18.810 --> 01:35:22.810
Everyone has emotions and at that moment I was stressed to say,

632
01:35:22.810 --> 01:35:27.810
guys, we have a project here and we have been working with Altes for two years now.

633
01:35:27.810 --> 01:35:32.810
Wonderful company, lovely people, they think along with us, have had a lot of patience with us.

634
01:35:32.810 --> 01:35:35.810
And to finally say, guys, we're not going to do it yet,

635
01:35:35.810 --> 01:35:39.810
was a letdown, often not a letdown, because I trust in the Lord, but how then?

636
01:35:39.810 --> 01:35:42.810
And that does create stress, yes, for sure.

637
01:35:42.810 --> 01:35:50.810
So then I said to Jens and to Steven, guys, this is the situation.

638
01:35:51.810 --> 01:35:59.810
And at first, he looks at me and suddenly he just bursts out with a proposal

639
01:35:59.810 --> 01:36:02.810
that I think is the hand of the Lord.

640
01:36:02.810 --> 01:36:08.810
He says, guys, why don't we just start with the...

641
01:36:12.810 --> 01:36:15.810
I knew it, I knew he was going to say that.

642
01:36:16.810 --> 01:36:19.810
Be quiet, but you didn't know anything, so that's good.

643
01:36:20.810 --> 01:36:26.810
He says, open church, why don't we just start, you have your own money,

644
01:36:26.810 --> 01:36:32.810
we have, Bram will present the collections shortly, but we have something like 700,000 of our own money

645
01:36:32.810 --> 01:36:39.810
and with that own money you can already set the rough construction for phase 1.

646
01:36:39.810 --> 01:36:47.810
And he said, and from that moment, you have to take my word for it, from that moment take the conversation,

647
01:36:47.810 --> 01:36:50.810
let's say, into a warm conversation.

648
01:36:50.810 --> 01:36:58.810
He said, you know, if we set the rough construction now, that means the building will be there,

649
01:36:58.810 --> 01:37:04.810
doors and windows in, closed off from wind and rain, that means the whole building will be there,

650
01:37:04.810 --> 01:37:08.810
but then it's still without systems, without heating, that's just rough construction, that's what it's called.

651
01:37:08.810 --> 01:37:15.810
But when that is there and then a heathen speaks to us, he says, when that is there,

652
01:37:15.810 --> 01:37:24.810
that's good for your church, because then you already see what you wanted to start, then you will also start.

653
01:37:25.810 --> 01:37:33.810
And I was like, dude, is there baptism water somewhere? I mean, what's holding you back?

654
01:37:33.810 --> 01:37:40.810
Wow, and he says, listen, if you are going to build, then you also keep it warm in you,

655
01:37:40.810 --> 01:37:43.810
yes in your head he said, I wanted to say soul, but he didn't say that,

656
01:37:43.810 --> 01:37:46.810
but then you also keep it warm in your church.

657
01:37:46.810 --> 01:37:50.810
Because the enthusiasm that is happening in your church, that is the only thing,

658
01:37:50.810 --> 01:37:52.810
but then you also keep it warm in your church.

659
01:37:52.810 --> 01:37:56.810
Because the enthusiasm that is there now, you have to hold on to, he said.

660
01:37:56.810 --> 01:38:00.810
He says, because suppose we now put a line under it and we stop.

661
01:38:00.810 --> 01:38:02.810
What then? Then it cools down, he says.

662
01:38:02.810 --> 01:38:05.810
And when it cools down, when then, he said.

663
01:38:05.810 --> 01:38:13.810
And when then, you keep that, the spirit keep that here, the swing, the yes, we are going to do this.

664
01:38:13.810 --> 01:38:17.810
Yes, what then? 28, 2026, 27, 28, we'll see.

665
01:38:17.810 --> 01:38:21.810
How am I supposed to keep saying this as a pastor from this podium?

666
01:38:21.810 --> 01:38:26.810
Should we then occasionally think about the new construction project, which we are going to do someday?

667
01:38:26.810 --> 01:38:31.810
Fine, if the Lord wants to build in 2035, that's fine by me.

668
01:38:31.810 --> 01:38:35.810
But we will consult the Lord about which door is open and which door is closed.

669
01:38:35.810 --> 01:38:42.810
And if you ask me, dear church, I am going to close a door or I have felt the value for your money,

670
01:38:42.810 --> 01:38:44.810
value for your money is clearly no,

671
01:38:44.810 --> 01:38:48.810
then I will go with a closed door to Altes and Altes, in my opinion,

672
01:38:48.810 --> 01:38:53.810
just throw a door open for us and I think we need to go through this door in Jesus' name.

673
01:38:53.810 --> 01:38:55.810
I think we need to start building.

674
01:38:58.810 --> 01:39:02.810
And the beautiful thing about this is, dear church, the beautiful thing about this is,

675
01:39:02.810 --> 01:39:07.810
is that the money of Open Church is in Open Church.

676
01:39:07.810 --> 01:39:14.810
The money of Open Church we have not had to borrow from a heathen so far.

677
01:39:14.810 --> 01:39:20.810
And okay, I want to pause on that, I want to share a few things about that.

678
01:39:20.810 --> 01:39:27.810
In the past few weeks, the Lord has touched me quite a bit about Ezra.

679
01:39:27.810 --> 01:39:32.810
I am reading in Ezra and that resonates in our story.

680
01:39:32.810 --> 01:39:36.810
Ezra is about building the temple, it is about provision,

681
01:39:36.810 --> 01:39:42.810
it is about opposition, it is about the halting of the temple construction for a certain period,

682
01:39:42.810 --> 01:39:45.810
it is about prophets, it is about kings,

683
01:39:45.810 --> 01:39:53.810
it is also about a pagan king, at whose heart the Holy Spirit knocks...

684
01:39:53.810 --> 01:39:54.810
Cyrus.

685
01:39:54.810 --> 01:39:57.810
Yes, Cyrus. I always say Cyrus and then you have Darius.

686
01:39:57.810 --> 01:39:58.810
Cyrus.

687
01:39:58.810 --> 01:40:02.810
Yes, Cyrus. Nonsense. He is just a pagan.

688
01:40:03.810 --> 01:40:07.810
But the Holy Spirit motivates this pagan to give.

689
01:40:07.810 --> 01:40:13.810
So again, we have all kinds of interpretations and all kinds of insights,

690
01:40:13.810 --> 01:40:18.810
but for example, I have a mortgage with a certain bank on my house, I am not afraid of that.

691
01:40:18.810 --> 01:40:22.810
So in principle, I am not afraid to get a mortgage somewhere, I am not afraid of that.

692
01:40:22.810 --> 01:40:27.810
A solid financing is just a solid financing, there is nothing wrong with it.

693
01:40:27.810 --> 01:40:32.810
But we see at this moment, Vanessa was at the board meeting, with the construction team meeting,

694
01:40:32.810 --> 01:40:38.810
everyone together, we now interpret that the Lord has said no to banks,

695
01:40:38.810 --> 01:40:40.810
and that the Lord has said no to value for your money,

696
01:40:40.810 --> 01:40:44.810
and that the Lord says yes, you will build yourselves with your own money.

697
01:40:44.810 --> 01:40:50.810
And I tell you, dear church, I interpret this as the will of the Lord.

698
01:40:50.810 --> 01:40:56.810
And I tell you also, I believe that when we take that shovel after this service,

699
01:40:56.810 --> 01:40:59.810
because soon we will all put on our coats and we will go outside.

700
01:40:59.810 --> 01:41:03.810
Because we are going to do as the Bible shows in Ezra,

701
01:41:03.810 --> 01:41:08.810
We will soon lay the foundation first and we will soon pray outside for this.

702
01:41:08.810 --> 01:41:16.810
Why? Because we are going to prophetically announce the building of the temple in worship to the Most High King.

703
01:41:16.810 --> 01:41:18.810
I am very excited about this.

704
01:41:19.810 --> 01:41:26.810
And one of the things I am excited about is that we are going to build a temple with our own money now,

705
01:41:26.810 --> 01:41:33.810
and I believe that growth and miraculous provisions will come with every step we take in building.

706
01:41:33.810 --> 01:41:39.810
This is typical of the Lord. That with every step you take, now we will do this.

707
01:41:39.810 --> 01:41:45.810
And now Lord, I want you to do that. And Joshua was blessed, step by step, says the Bible.

708
01:41:45.810 --> 01:41:50.810
And so I believe that we will step by step, phased in holiness with King Jesus,

709
01:41:50.810 --> 01:41:56.810
expect from Him in the enthusiasm of Open Church, and that is why we will hold collections.

710
01:41:56.810 --> 01:41:58.810
For the money is within.

711
01:41:58.810 --> 01:42:02.810
Vanessa and I wrote a letter to the board at the beginning of this year again,

712
01:42:02.810 --> 01:42:07.810
that we contribute our part in the offerings to this temple.

713
01:42:07.810 --> 01:42:11.810
We give substantially, and I say it out loud not to boast,

714
01:42:11.810 --> 01:42:15.810
but I say, if the money is within, then I must participate.

715
01:42:15.810 --> 01:42:20.810
This is my church for God's kingdom, for the generations to come.

716
01:42:20.810 --> 01:42:23.810
And this is your church. This is not my church, but this is your church.

717
01:42:23.810 --> 01:42:27.810
And we all must say, this is my church.

718
01:42:27.810 --> 01:42:31.810
And if we all see that it is our church, and we contribute what we have,

719
01:42:31.810 --> 01:42:35.810
even though it may not be enough, God looks at your heart.

720
01:42:36.810 --> 01:42:44.810
And if He sees that you give exuberantly from your heart, then He can perform a miracle over it.

721
01:42:44.810 --> 01:42:48.810
And I think the Lord says, put the shovel in the ground in faith.

722
01:42:48.810 --> 01:42:51.810
And we are just going to start with our own money.

723
01:42:51.810 --> 01:42:55.810
And I praise the Lord.

724
01:42:55.810 --> 01:43:04.810
Because, mortgages, value for your money, crowdfunding, in five years we need to refinance,

725
01:43:04.810 --> 01:43:08.810
what will the economy look like then? Was it then in progress?

726
01:43:08.810 --> 01:43:10.810
Can we then pay it back?

727
01:43:10.810 --> 01:43:15.810
And if it takes us a week just to bring in two hundred thousand of the 1.7,

728
01:43:15.810 --> 01:43:18.810
how difficult will it perhaps be to bring it in five years from now?

729
01:43:18.810 --> 01:43:22.810
And if you don't bring it in then, you have a big problem with all of us.

730
01:43:22.810 --> 01:43:26.810
But in this way, because you know what the fun thing is, dear church?

731
01:43:26.810 --> 01:43:30.810
At this moment we are debt-free as a church.

732
01:43:30.810 --> 01:43:37.810
Because this hall, praise the Lord yes, we built this hall with a mortgage.

733
01:43:37.810 --> 01:43:43.810
And we will have paid off this mortgage by 2025, for this project, we have neatly paid off this mortgage.

734
01:43:43.810 --> 01:43:46.810
So we have no mortgages or debts outstanding.

735
01:43:46.810 --> 01:43:48.810
