01:59:19.810 --> 01:59:27.810
That means we currently have 765,000 in savings.

977
01:59:27.810 --> 01:59:29.810
I'll wrap it up.

978
01:59:29.810 --> 01:59:33.810
765,000 is just in our church's savings accounts.

979
01:59:35.810 --> 01:59:41.810
When we start the rough construction, the costs will be 600,000.

980
01:59:43.810 --> 01:59:45.810
And that is the remark.

981
01:59:45.810 --> 01:59:48.810
Look, we simply have that in the savings account.

982
01:59:48.810 --> 01:59:50.810
The rough construction can be set up.

983
01:59:50.810 --> 01:59:52.810
That's why you can start on it.

984
01:59:52.810 --> 01:59:55.810
Because what you start, you must be able to finish.

985
01:59:55.810 --> 01:59:58.810
If you say we are going to set up the rough construction, you must also be able to finish it.

986
01:59:58.810 --> 02:00:00.810
So then we know, we can afford this.

987
02:00:00.810 --> 02:00:02.810
And we still have a nice margin left.

988
02:00:02.810 --> 02:00:07.810
How it will proceed, I can't fill that in right now.

989
02:00:07.810 --> 02:00:20.810
We will not stop looking for ways to get money.

990
02:00:20.810 --> 02:00:22.810
In all sorts of forms.

991
02:00:22.810 --> 02:00:24.810
We will not stop with that.

992
02:00:24.810 --> 02:00:29.810
But I don't see many options at the moment.

993
02:00:29.810 --> 02:00:32.810
If anyone knows of a money tree somewhere.

994
02:00:32.810 --> 02:00:34.810
I would appreciate it.

995
02:00:34.810 --> 02:00:36.810
I would appreciate it.

996
02:00:36.810 --> 02:00:38.810
No, joking.

997
02:00:38.810 --> 02:00:40.810
We won't stop.

998
02:00:40.810 --> 02:00:42.810
We will just look for where there are possibilities.

999
02:00:42.810 --> 02:00:44.810
Where possibilities arise.

1000
02:00:44.810 --> 02:00:47.810
We will keep following up on contacts if they exist.

1001
02:00:47.810 --> 02:00:53.810
We continue to discuss with people what experiences there are.

1002
02:00:53.810 --> 02:00:55.810
What options do you see?

1003
02:00:57.810 --> 02:01:02.810
But I am gradually getting the feeling that God is going to lead us step by step in this.

1004
02:01:03.810 --> 02:01:07.810
And not towards the whole big thing all at once.

1005
02:01:08.810 --> 02:01:10.810
I want to make something very clear.

1006
02:01:10.810 --> 02:01:15.810
There have been people, a considerable number of people, who have pledged a loan.

1007
02:01:15.810 --> 02:01:20.810
They have also been working to do that loan through Value for Your Money.

1008
02:01:21.810 --> 02:01:23.810
We will also stop that.

1009
02:01:24.810 --> 02:01:31.810
Because the current financing plan was based on five different puzzle pieces.

1010
02:01:31.810 --> 02:01:36.810
And together those puzzle pieces form a coherent complete plan.

1011
02:01:37.810 --> 02:01:41.810
If one very large puzzle piece falls out.

1012
02:01:41.810 --> 02:01:45.810
Then the other puzzle pieces no longer fit.

1013
02:01:50.810 --> 02:01:58.810
That also means that the promise, as some people have made it to take out a loan.

1014
02:01:59.810 --> 02:02:01.810
How should I put this?

1015
02:02:01.810 --> 02:02:04.810
As a church, we will not hold you to that promise.

1016
02:02:05.810 --> 02:02:09.810
Because we are going to look at this in a new situation.

1017
02:02:10.810 --> 02:02:17.810
It is very possible that in a few months we will be in a situation where we say again.

1018
02:02:17.810 --> 02:02:20.810
Please think about what you can lend to the church?

1019
02:02:20.810 --> 02:02:23.810
What can you give to the church? What can you lend to the church?

1020
02:02:24.810 --> 02:02:26.810
We cannot foresee that right now.

1021
02:02:26.810 --> 02:02:31.810
So it becomes a new consideration. Am I clear about that?

1022
02:02:31.810 --> 02:02:41.810
Let me see, is there anything I needed to say?

1023
02:02:54.810 --> 02:02:57.810
Let us continue to be generous.

1024
02:02:58.810 --> 02:03:01.810
Let us continue on this track.

1025
02:03:05.810 --> 02:03:10.810
If we can have raised a million like this.

1026
02:03:11.810 --> 02:03:16.810
Then it is also possible to raise the next million in the foreseeable future.

1027
02:03:17.810 --> 02:03:19.810
Don't calculate how that should be done.

1028
02:03:20.810 --> 02:03:27.810
I just said, if I had started calculating two years ago, I wouldn't have come to this million either.

1029
02:03:27.810 --> 02:03:28.810
Really not.

1030
02:03:29.810 --> 02:03:31.810
That is when God starts to bless.

1031
02:03:35.810 --> 02:03:41.810
We walk. And in the walking that we do, new things come to light.

1032
02:03:42.810 --> 02:03:45.810
Confirm God. Bless God.

1033
02:03:46.810 --> 02:03:49.810
We all know the way we can give.

1034
02:03:49.810 --> 02:03:51.810
This is a fantastic picture.

1035
02:03:51.810 --> 02:03:53.810
Do you see it in your mind?

1036
02:03:55.810 --> 02:03:58.810
Let us give with faith.

1037
02:03:59.810 --> 02:04:04.810
Let us occasionally think about what can I do.

1038
02:04:06.810 --> 02:04:09.810
Look for yourself. Discuss it at home.

1039
02:04:09.810 --> 02:04:16.810
Don't do absurd idiotic things, but look where can I help?

1040
02:04:16.810 --> 02:04:19.810
How can I help? How can I perhaps do a little extra?

1041
02:04:19.810 --> 02:04:22.810
How can I perhaps create something extra?

1042
02:04:23.810 --> 02:04:25.810
Be creative with each other.

1043
02:04:26.810 --> 02:04:27.810
Shall we do that?

1044
02:04:27.810 --> 02:04:35.810
Shall we make a beautiful start with a lovely first collection in this new year?

1045
02:04:35.810 --> 02:04:39.810
In which a completely new project is started.

1046
02:04:48.810 --> 02:04:50.810
So this is what we are going to do now.

1047
02:04:50.810 --> 02:04:52.810
We are going outside. I am going to close the service.

1048
02:04:52.810 --> 02:04:54.810
We are going outside together.

1049
02:04:56.810 --> 02:05:03.810
The new construction project, the rough construction of the children's church, is therefore the building.

1050
02:05:03.810 --> 02:05:06.810
If all goes well, we have a picture of that. By the way, we just saw it.

1051
02:05:06.810 --> 02:05:08.810
That was the picture of the children's church.

1052
02:05:09.810 --> 02:05:17.810
I have made an agreement with myself that the theme of 2026, I talked about it with Vanessa,

1053
02:05:17.810 --> 02:05:20.810
is A House for the Generations.

1054
02:05:20.810 --> 02:05:27.810
I believe that the building we are going to build, what we can do together now,

1055
02:05:27.810 --> 02:05:30.810
and this is the generation, we are the generation,

1056
02:05:30.810 --> 02:05:33.810
the people who have jobs, earn money.

1057
02:05:33.810 --> 02:05:39.810
We are that generation that is going to build a church for the generations that will come after us.

1058
02:05:39.810 --> 02:05:46.810
And I, in that crazy week I had last week, had Cindy ask me

1059
02:05:46.810 --> 02:05:48.810
can you lead the service on Friday night?

1060
02:05:48.810 --> 02:05:53.810
And actually, everything, my whole head was completely...

1061
02:05:53.810 --> 02:05:56.810
And I thought, no man, with everything that is in me, no.

1062
02:05:56.810 --> 02:05:59.810
I just don't feel like working with the youth.

1063
02:05:59.810 --> 02:06:02.810
I actually didn't have the tension span for it anymore.

1064
02:06:02.810 --> 02:06:04.810
And especially not with teenagers.

1065
02:06:06.810 --> 02:06:08.810
And it was just nice.

1066
02:06:08.810 --> 02:06:14.810
Because God gave me insight that what we do is not for ourselves.

1067
02:06:14.810 --> 02:06:16.810
We do it for the generations.

1068
02:06:16.810 --> 02:06:17.810
We do it for the teenagers.

1069
02:06:17.810 --> 02:06:19.810
We do it for the children.

1070
02:06:19.810 --> 02:06:21.810
We do it for the children of the children.

1071
02:06:21.810 --> 02:06:24.810
And the children of the children of the children, until Jesus returns.

1072
02:06:24.810 --> 02:06:29.810
And I prophesy again, this church will remain until Jesus returns.

1073
02:06:29.810 --> 02:06:32.810
This church will not die, will not tear apart.

1074
02:06:32.810 --> 02:06:35.810
This church will exist until the Lord returns.

1075
02:06:35.810 --> 02:06:39.810
So what we are doing now is a seed in eternity.

1076
02:06:39.810 --> 02:06:44.810
Namely, what we are sowing now in Open Church will bear fruit.

1077
02:06:44.810 --> 02:06:46.810
It will come to a harvest.

1078
02:06:46.810 --> 02:06:49.810
It will come to fruition, as they say in English.

1079
02:06:49.810 --> 02:06:53.810
And the children and the children and the children and the children, the generations after us.

1080
02:06:53.810 --> 02:06:55.810
A house for the generations.

1081
02:06:55.810 --> 02:06:58.810
This church may be that, in Jesus' name.

1082
02:06:58.810 --> 02:07:04.810
And how beautiful it is, that we have a house for the generations, the youngest ones.

1083
02:07:04.810 --> 02:07:07.810
We will build the children's church first.

1084
02:07:07.810 --> 02:07:10.810
So that we can prophetically see what we are doing.

1085
02:07:10.810 --> 02:07:12.810
We are not building the adult church first.

1086
02:07:12.810 --> 02:07:14.810
We are not doing this first for ourselves.

1087
02:07:14.810 --> 02:07:16.810
We are building the generations first.

1088
02:07:16.810 --> 02:07:18.810
That is where we will begin.

1089
02:07:18.810 --> 02:07:20.810
So I want to invite all of us.

1090
02:07:20.810 --> 02:07:21.810
Put on your coat.

1091
02:07:21.810 --> 02:07:23.810
And we will stand on that side.

1092
02:07:23.810 --> 02:07:25.810
Go stand in the woods, stand in the snow.

1093
02:07:25.810 --> 02:07:27.810
I don't care, it's cold outside.

1094
02:07:27.810 --> 02:07:29.810
Soon you can go to a nice warm house.

1095
02:07:29.810 --> 02:07:31.810
But there we will put the first shovel in the ground.

1096
02:07:31.810 --> 02:07:33.810
And we will pray to the Lord.

1097
02:07:33.810 --> 02:07:38.810
For we are going to begin with the foundation of the house of the generations.

1098
02:07:38.810 --> 02:07:39.810
Amen.
